{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a fully serverless REST API using Function Compute behind an API Gateway, with Tair and Tablestore for spiky traffic."}
{"t":"plan","products":["mobile-app","dns","cloud-native-api-gateway","fc","tair","tablestore","sls"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"region","text":"Singapore region","alt":"Another region"}
{"t":"assume","id":"auth","text":"API key auth at the gateway","alt":"OAuth2 or JWT validation"}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"mobile-app","label":"Mobile app","group":"internet","why":"Calls the REST API over HTTPS."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the API domain to the gateway."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-dns","from":"app","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"API VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"gw","product":"cloud-native-api-gateway","label":"API Gateway","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes REST calls, throttles spikes and handles auth."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-gw","from":"app","to":"gw","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"api","product":"fc","label":"API functions","group":"vpc","why":"Runs request handlers; scales to zero and bills per invocation."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gw-api","from":"gw","to":"api","label":"HTTP"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Hot data cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Absorbs read spikes with sub-millisecond latency."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-cache","from":"api","to":"cache","label":"read/write"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"tablestore","label":"Data store","group":"sg","why":"Serverless NoSQL that auto-scales for unpredictable write spikes."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-db","from":"api","to":"db","label":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Collects function logs for debugging and monitoring."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-logs","from":"api","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"ask","id":"payload-size","text":"What is the typical request and response payload size?","options":["Under 1 KB","1–10 KB","Over 10 KB"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"latency","text":"Do you need single-digit millisecond latency for reads?","options":["Yes, very strict","Standard is fine"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Serverless REST API on Function Compute behind Cloud-native API Gateway, with Tair cache and Tablestore, paying only per request."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a RAG assistant on ACK using Dify, Model Studio for Qwen models, and Elasticsearch for policy document search."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","alb","ack","dify-on-ack","model-studio","elasticsearch","oss","nat"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"build-vs-buy","text":"Self-hosted RAG to index your own wiki and policies","alt":"Ready-made workplace agent like QwenWork"}
{"t":"assume","id":"team-size","text":"Internal tool for up to 500 employees","alt":"Company-wide rollout over 1000 users"}
{"t":"group","id":"internal","kind":"external","label":"Corporate network","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Employees","group":"internal","why":"Staff asking questions about policies and wiki."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Internal DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the assistant hostname inside the corporate network."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Assistant VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes internal HTTPS traffic to the Dify cluster."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-alb","from":"users","to":"alb","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"ack","product":"ack","label":"ACK cluster","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs Dify containers with high availability."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-ack","from":"alb","to":"ack"}
{"t":"node","id":"dify","product":"dify-on-ack","label":"Dify RAG app","group":"vpc","attachTo":"ack","why":"Low-code builder for the policy Q&A agent and RAG pipeline."}
{"t":"say","text":"Dify calls Qwen via Model Studio, searches docs in Elasticsearch, and reads uploaded files from OSS."}
{"t":"node","id":"llm","product":"model-studio","label":"Model Studio (Qwen)","group":"sg","why":"Hosts Qwen models that generate answers from retrieved context."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-llm","from":"ack","to":"llm","label":"LLM API"}
{"t":"node","id":"vector","product":"elasticsearch","label":"Elasticsearch","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Vector store indexing policy documents and wiki pages for RAG."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-vector","from":"ack","to":"vector","label":"search"}
{"t":"node","id":"docs","product":"oss","label":"Document store","group":"sg","why":"Stores raw policy PDFs and wiki exports for ingestion."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-docs","from":"ack","to":"docs","label":"read files"}
{"t":"node","id":"nat","product":"nat","label":"NAT Gateway","group":"vpc","why":"Gives ACK private outbound access to call Model Studio APIs."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-nat","from":"ack","to":"nat","kind":"control"}
{"t":"ask","id":"wiki-source","text":"Where do your policy documents and wiki live today?","options":["Files uploaded manually","Confluence or Notion API","SharePoint or OneDrive"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"auth-method","text":"How should employees authenticate to the assistant?","options":["SSO via IDaaS","Corporate LDAP","No auth for now"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Internal RAG assistant built with Dify on ACK, Qwen via Model Studio, Elasticsearch for vector search, and OSS for document storage."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a highly available online store in Singapore with ESA, ALB, WAF, auto-scaling ECS, Tair cache and RDS."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","waf","ecs","ess","tair","rds","oss","sls","nat"]}
{"t":"req","text":"Store serves Southeast Asia with 30k daily users and sales peaks"}
{"t":"assume","id":"public-store","text":"Public-facing online store","alt":"Internal only"}
{"t":"assume","id":"region","text":"Singapore region for Southeast Asia latency","alt":"Jakarta region"}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Shoppers","group":"internet","why":"30k daily shoppers from Southeast Asia."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the store domain to ESA edge."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Caches static assets and accelerates dynamic requests across Southeast Asia."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Store VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Distributes traffic across two zones for high availability."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Protects against OWASP attacks and bots during sales peaks."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"Web servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the store application across two availability zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"scaling","product":"ess","label":"Auto Scaling","group":"vpc","attachTo":"app","why":"Scales instances up during big sales peaks automatically."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"say","text":"Adding session cache, database, media storage and outbound internet access."}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores sessions and hot product data for fast reads."}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Orders DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Primary relational database with zone-level standby."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-cache","from":"app","to":"cache"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"media","product":"oss","label":"Product images","group":"sg","why":"Stores product images served by ESA at the edge."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-media","from":"esa","to":"media","label":"images"}
{"t":"node","id":"nat","product":"nat","label":"NAT Gateway","group":"vpc","why":"Provides outbound internet for ECS patching and API calls."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-nat","from":"app","to":"nat","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralizes application and access logs for monitoring."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"ask","id":"db-engine","text":"Which database engine do you prefer?","options":["MySQL","PostgreSQL"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"peak-scale","text":"How many concurrent users during peak sales?","options":["5,000","20,000","50,000+"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Highly available online store in Singapore with ESA, ALB+WAF, auto-scaling ECS across two zones, Tair cache, RDS and OSS."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a Kubernetes platform for your 20 Java microservices with MSE Nacos, an API gateway, RocketMQ, Tair and PolarDB."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","alb","ack","acr","mse","cloud-native-api-gateway","rocketmq","tair","polardb","sls","prometheus"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"exposure","text":"Public-facing services","alt":"Internal only"}
{"t":"assume","id":"region","text":"Singapore region","alt":"Another region"}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Users","group":"internet","why":"Clients calling the microservices."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Alibaba Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the API domain to ALB."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Microservices VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Ingress load balancer spreading traffic across zones."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-alb","from":"users","to":"alb","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"gateway","product":"cloud-native-api-gateway","label":"API Gateway","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Single entry point routing to backend services."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-gateway","from":"alb","to":"gateway","label":"HTTP"}
{"t":"node","id":"ack","product":"ack","label":"ACK Cluster","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the 20 Java microservices on Kubernetes."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gateway-ack","from":"gateway","to":"ack","label":"gRPC/HTTP"}
{"t":"node","id":"acr","product":"acr","label":"Container Registry","group":"sg","why":"Stores container images for the microservices."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-acr","from":"ack","to":"acr","label":"pull images","kind":"control"}
{"t":"say","text":"MSE Nacos handles service discovery and config, RocketMQ async messaging, Tair caching, and PolarDB relational storage."}
{"t":"node","id":"mse","product":"mse","label":"MSE Nacos","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Service registry and configuration center for Java microservices."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-mse","from":"ack","to":"mse","label":"discovery","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"rocketmq","product":"rocketmq","label":"RocketMQ","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Async messaging between microservices."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-rocketmq","from":"ack","to":"rocketmq","label":"events","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Tair Cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"In-memory cache for hot data and sessions."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-cache","from":"ack","to":"cache","label":"Redis"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"polardb","label":"PolarDB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Relational database with compute-storage separation."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-db","from":"ack","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"SLS","group":"sg","why":"Centralized log collection and analysis."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-logs","from":"ack","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"metrics","product":"prometheus","label":"Prometheus","group":"sg","why":"Metrics monitoring for ACK workloads."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-metrics","from":"ack","to":"metrics","kind":"control"}
{"t":"ask","id":"db-engine","text":"Which relational engine do you prefer?","options":["MySQL","PostgreSQL","Oracle-compatible"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"team-size","text":"How large is the team managing this cluster?","options":["Small (1-5 engineers)","Medium (6-20 engineers)","Large (20+ engineers)"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Kubernetes platform with ACK, MSE Nacos, Cloud-native API Gateway, RocketMQ, Tair and PolarDB for 20 Java microservices."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a data platform that replicates MySQL in real time via DTS, runs nightly batch in MaxCompute, and serves dashboards with Hologres and Quick BI."}
{"t":"plan","products":["rds","dts","maxcompute","dataworks","hologres","quick-bi","sls","oss"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"source","text":"Source is an existing Alibaba Cloud RDS MySQL","alt":"On-premises or other cloud MySQL"}
{"t":"assume","id":"region","text":"Platform deployed in Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","alt":"Another region"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Data Platform VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"rds","product":"rds","label":"Orders MySQL","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Source order database to replicate from."}
{"t":"node","id":"dts","product":"dts","label":"DTS Sync","group":"sg","why":"Streams CDC changes from MySQL to the warehouse in real time."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-rds-dts","from":"rds","to":"dts","label":"CDC","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"maxcompute","product":"maxcompute","label":"MaxCompute Warehouse","group":"sg","why":"Stores replicated data and runs nightly batch analytics jobs."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dts-maxcompute","from":"dts","to":"maxcompute","label":"sync","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"dataworks","product":"dataworks","label":"DataWorks Scheduler","group":"sg","why":"Orchestrates nightly ETL pipelines over MaxCompute tables."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dataworks-maxcompute","from":"dataworks","to":"maxcompute","label":"ETL","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"hologres","product":"hologres","label":"Hologres Serving","group":"sg","why":"Interactive serving layer for sub-second dashboard queries."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-maxcompute-hologres","from":"maxcompute","to":"hologres","label":"batch load","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"quickbi","product":"quick-bi","label":"Quick BI Dashboards","group":"sg","why":"Gives business users self-service reports over Hologres."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-hologres-quickbi","from":"hologres","to":"quickbi","label":"SQL","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"oss","product":"oss","label":"Data Lake Storage","group":"sg","why":"Landing zone for raw files and archival exports."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-maxcompute-oss","from":"maxcompute","to":"oss","label":"export","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"sls","product":"sls","label":"Pipeline Logs","group":"sg","why":"Collects ETL and sync logs for monitoring and alerting."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dataworks-sls","from":"dataworks","to":"sls","kind":"control"}
{"t":"ask","id":"source-location","text":"Where does your source MySQL currently run?","options":["Alibaba Cloud RDS","On-premises data center","AWS or Azure"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"latency","text":"How fresh must the dashboard data be?","options":["Real-time (seconds)","Hourly micro-batch","Nightly only"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Real-time MySQL replication via DTS into MaxCompute, nightly DataWorks ETL, Hologres serving, and Quick BI dashboards."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw your on-premises data center connected to Alibaba Cloud Singapore over Express Connect, with SMC for step-by-step VM migration."}
{"t":"plan","products":["onprem-dc","express-connect","vpc","ecs","smc"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"migration-scope","text":"Migrating a few dozen VMs gradually","alt":"Hundreds of VMs in big-bang cutover"}
{"t":"group","id":"onprem","kind":"onprem","label":"On-premises DC","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"onprem-dc","product":"onprem-dc","label":"Singapore DC","group":"onprem","why":"Your existing data center hosting the VMs to migrate."}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Migration VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"express-connect","product":"express-connect","label":"Express Connect","group":"vpc","why":"Private dedicated link between your DC and Alibaba Cloud VPC."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-onprem-dc-express-connect","from":"onprem-dc","to":"express-connect","label":"private link"}
{"t":"node","id":"target-vms","product":"ecs","label":"Migrated ECS instances","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Destination VMs in Alibaba Cloud after each migration wave."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-express-connect-target-vms","from":"express-connect","to":"target-vms","label":"VPC traffic"}
{"t":"node","id":"smc","product":"smc","label":"Server Migration Center","group":"sg","why":"Incrementally replicates on-prem VMs to ECS without downtime."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-onprem-dc-smc","from":"onprem-dc","to":"smc","label":"replicate","kind":"data"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-smc-target-vms","from":"smc","to":"target-vms","label":"deploy","kind":"control"}
{"t":"ask","id":"link-bandwidth","text":"How much steady traffic will flow between your DC and cloud during migration?","options":["Under 1 Gbps","1-10 Gbps","Over 10 Gbps"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"vm-os","text":"What OS do your on-premises VMs run?","options":["Linux","Windows","Mixed"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"On-premises Singapore DC linked to Alibaba Cloud via Express Connect, with Server Migration Center driving phased VM migration to ECS."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a real-time IoT telemetry pipeline: devices to IoT Platform, Flink for anomaly detection, and DataV for the live dashboard."}
{"t":"plan","products":["iot-devices","iot-platform","kafka","flink","tair","tablestore","sls","datav","smq"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"region","text":"Singapore region","alt":"Another region"}
{"t":"assume","id":"protocol","text":"Devices use MQTT via IoT Platform","alt":"Direct Kafka ingestion"}
{"t":"group","id":"field","kind":"external","label":"Field","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"devices","product":"iot-devices","label":"100k IoT devices","group":"field","why":"Sensors sending telemetry every few seconds."}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"IoT VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"iot","product":"iot-platform","label":"IoT Platform","group":"sg","why":"Ingests MQTT telemetry from 100k devices at scale."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-devices-iot","from":"devices","to":"iot","label":"MQTT","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"kafka","product":"kafka","label":"Kafka","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Buffers high-throughput telemetry for stream processing."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-iot-kafka","from":"iot","to":"kafka","label":"stream","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"flink","product":"flink","label":"Flink","group":"vpc","why":"Real-time anomaly detection over device telemetry."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-kafka-flink","from":"kafka","to":"flink","label":"consume","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Tair","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Holds latest device state for sub-second dashboard reads."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-flink-cache","from":"flink","to":"cache","label":"state","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"tsdb","product":"tablestore","label":"Tablestore","group":"sg","why":"Stores raw time-series telemetry at massive scale."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-flink-tsdb","from":"flink","to":"tsdb","label":"persist","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"alerts","product":"smq","label":"SMQ","group":"sg","why":"Decouples anomaly alerts for downstream consumers."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-flink-alerts","from":"flink","to":"alerts","label":"anomalies","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"SLS","group":"sg","why":"Centralizes pipeline logs and alert audit trails."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-flink-logs","from":"flink","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"dashboard","product":"datav","label":"DataV","group":"sg","why":"Live large-screen dashboard of device health and anomalies."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-cache-dashboard","from":"cache","to":"dashboard","label":"live data","kind":"data"}
{"t":"ask","id":"alert-target","text":"Where should anomaly alerts be delivered?","options":["Webhook or API","SMS via SMS service","DingTalk or chat app"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"retention","text":"How long must raw telemetry be retained?","options":["7 days hot only","30 days in Tablestore","Over 1 year, archive to OSS"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Real-time IoT pipeline: 100k devices via IoT Platform into Kafka, Flink anomaly detection, Tair for live DataV dashboards, SMQ for alerts."}

{"t":"say","text":"Qoder Teams gives your 25 developers an agentic coding assistant with SSO, admin controls and usage analytics."}
{"t":"rec","product":"qoder-teams","fit":"primary","why":"Agentic coding platform for teams with SSO, admin dashboard and usage analytics."}
{"t":"rec","product":"model-studio","fit":"complement","why":"Provides the Qwen model API keys that power Qoder Teams agents."}
{"t":"rec","product":"cloudsso","fit":"complement","why":"SAML single sign-on and SCIM provisioning for your identity provider."}
{"t":"done","summary":"Recommended Qoder Teams with Model Studio and CloudSSO for a governed agentic coding assistant for 25 developers."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a secure multi-account landing zone with central identity, audit logging, threat detection and network firewalls."}
{"t":"plan","products":["acgc","resource-management","cloudsso","ram","idaas","actiontrail","sls","security-center","cloud-firewall","cloud-config"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"accounts","text":"Three accounts: management, security, workload","alt":"Single account with resource groups"}
{"t":"node","id":"acgc","product":"acgc","label":"Governance Center","group":null,"why":"Automates multi-account landing zone setup and guardrails."}
{"t":"node","id":"rd","product":"resource-management","label":"Resource Directory","group":null,"why":"Organizes accounts into OUs for centralized governance."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-acgc-rd","from":"acgc","to":"rd","kind":"control","label":"governs"}
{"t":"node","id":"cloudsso","product":"cloudsso","label":"CloudSSO","group":null,"why":"SAML SSO and SCIM provisioning across all accounts."}
{"t":"node","id":"idaas","product":"idaas","label":"IDaaS","group":null,"why":"Central workforce directory and MFA for CloudSSO."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-idaas-cloudsso","from":"idaas","to":"cloudsso","kind":"control","label":"identity"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-cloudsso-rd","from":"cloudsso","to":"rd","kind":"control","label":"provisions"}
{"t":"node","id":"ram","product":"ram","label":"RAM","group":null,"why":"Roles and policies enforced in every member account."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-rd-ram","from":"rd","to":"ram","kind":"control","label":"policies"}
{"t":"node","id":"config","product":"cloud-config","label":"Cloud Config","group":null,"why":"Continuous compliance evaluation of resource configurations."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-acgc-config","from":"acgc","to":"config","kind":"control","label":"rules"}
{"t":"node","id":"actiontrail","product":"actiontrail","label":"ActionTrail","group":null,"why":"Captures all API and console actions across accounts."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-rd-actiontrail","from":"rd","to":"actiontrail","kind":"control","label":"audits"}
{"t":"node","id":"sls","product":"sls","label":"Log Service","group":null,"why":"Stores and analyzes audit logs delivered by ActionTrail."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-actiontrail-sls","from":"actiontrail","to":"sls","kind":"async","label":"logs"}
{"t":"node","id":"sec-center","product":"security-center","label":"Security Center","group":null,"why":"Threat detection, vulnerability scanning and Agentic SOC."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-sec-center-sls","from":"sec-center","to":"sls","kind":"control","label":"analyzes"}
{"t":"node","id":"fw","product":"cloud-firewall","label":"Cloud Firewall","group":null,"why":"Centralized internet, VPC and NAT border firewall rules."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-sec-center-fw","from":"sec-center","to":"fw","kind":"control","label":"orchestrates"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Multi-account landing zone governed by ACGC with CloudSSO/IDaaS identity, ActionTrail/SLS audit, Security Center threats and Cloud Firewall."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a multi-region SaaS with GTM for automatic failover, ESA for global low latency, and three regional stacks."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","gtm","esa","alb","waf","ecs","rds","tair","dts","sls"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"primary-region","text":"Singapore is the primary region","alt":"Another region as primary"}
{"t":"assume","id":"scale","text":"About 50k global users","alt":"Over 500k global users"}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
